Noto Sans Medium (SIL Open Font License 1.1, see OFL.txt).

The TTF is not in the repository; only the atlas baked from it
(../src/atlas.bin) is. Re-bake with:

    cargo run -p bake-atlas -- NotoSans-Medium.ttf crates/ui/src/atlas.bin

Check that the committed atlas is what the tool bakes (the test skips itself
unless the font matches the length and hash below, so point it at the exact
file; add `-- --nocapture` to see a "skipped" line):

    INACIRCLE_FONT=/path/to/NotoSans-Medium.ttf cargo test -p bake-atlas -- --nocapture

Source:  https://github.com/notofonts/notofonts.github.io/blob/main/fonts/NotoSans/hinted/ttf/NotoSans-Medium.ttf
